      "title": {
        "en": "Energetic play and secure boarding"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners report that their pets show genuine excitement when arriving at Petopia in Scarborough, eagerly running inside to greet canine playmates. Reviewers note that dogs are never confined to crates all day and return home cheerful and well exercised. Clients appreciate that small dogs mingle safely alongside larger companions under continuous supervision."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate handlers and attentive supervision"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly praise the experienced daycare team and knowledgeable management for treating guest dogs like extended family. Attendants are commended for their gentle handling, patience, and certification in canine first aid. Pet parents frequently emphasize feeling complete peace of mind while away on holiday or long work shifts."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spacious facility with live webcams"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients describe the boarding and daycare premises as spotlessly clean, well maintained, and thoughtfully equipped for active play. Owners value the expansive off-leash outdoor dog park and the access to live streaming cameras throughout the day. Convenient parking and extended drop-off hours make daily visits straightforward for working commuters."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can owners monitor their dogs via webcam?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients can log into live streaming webcams during daycare hours to check on their pets' activities."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are dogs kept in crates during daycare?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "No, Petopia offers cage-free group playrooms and an outdoor dog park rather than keeping dogs crated."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the facility provide overnight staff supervision?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, boarding dogs receive round-the-clock supervision with on-site staff present throughout the night."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are additional grooming services offered during boarding?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet parents can schedule bathing, coat brushing, and nail trims during daycare or overnight stays."
      },
      "basis": "both"
